  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are two matrices such that the order of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is <math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, if <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>A</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>B</mtext></mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mtext>B</mtext><msup> <mtext>A</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> are both defined, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "order of <math> <msup> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> </math> is <math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "order of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mtext>A</mtext></mrow> </math> is <math><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "order of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mtext>A</mtext></mrow> </math> is <math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mtext>A</mtext></mrow> </math> is not defined",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, order of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∵</mo><msup> <mtext>A</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mtext>B</mtext></mrow> </math> is defined so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mtext>B</mtext><msup> <mtext>A</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> is defined so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mo>⇒</mo> </math> order of <math> <mtext>B</mtext> </math> is <math> <mrow> <mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mo>∴</mo> </math> order of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mtext>A</mtext></mrow> </math> is <math> <mrow> <mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow> </math>"
  }
